~ stupid
Micah: [#sprite=happy]That's how things work around here. Not too complicated, but think it might take you a while to get used to it, considering your... shortcomings. 
- What shortcomings?
	Micah: [#sprite=happy]Oh, you know. 
	- Sure don't. Enlighten me. 
		Micah: Don't worry about it too much. I'm just messing around. 
		Micah: [#sprite=happy]Mostly. 
		- Tone it down a bit. I'm not your playmate.
			Micah: Okay. Sorry.[do Variables.set_char_var("NPC_1", "relationship", 2)] => sarah
		- It's alright. I'm just playing along. 
			Micah: [#sprite=happy]Hm. I might just end up liking you. [do Variables.set_char_var("NPC_1", "relationship", 4)]
			Micah: [#sprite=happy]And you could sure use me as a friend, you know. 
			Micah: We'll see, though. I'm picky when it comes to friends. 
			- Time will tell. 
				Micah: Uh huh. => sarah
			- What an honour. 
				Micah: [#sprite=happy]Hahah. Damn right. => sarah
	- Whatever, kid. 
		Micah: [#sprite=upset]I'm not a kid. I'm eleven. You stop being a kid when you're ten. [do Variables.set_char_var("NPC_1", "relationship", 2)]
		Micah: Anyway, I'm just messing around. Don't take me too seriously. => sarah
	- You think I'm stupid?
		Micah: [#sprite=happy]Hahah, yeah. 
		- Watch yourself. I'm not your playmate.
			Micah: Hey, I'm just messing. Sorry.
			- Yeah, tone it down in the future.
				Micah: Okay. I will.[do Variables.set_char_var("NPC_1", "relationship", 2)] => sarah
			- Don't worry about it too much. I overreacted a bit. 
				Micah: [#sprite=happy]That's alright. Give and forget, as the saying goes. => sarah
		- Hey, don't judge a book by its cover. 
			Micah: [#sprite=upset]Don't much like books. Not sure what that has to do with anything.
			Micah: [#sprite=upset]Guess you really aren't all that bright. 
			- ...
				Micah: [#sprite=happy]Cat got your tongue? 
				Micah: I'm just messing around.
				Micah: [#sprite=happy]Mostly. => sarah
			- Guess so.
				Micah: [#sprite=happy]Hahaha. => sarah
			- You sure like to talk a lot. 
				Micah: [#sprite=happy]Sure do. You'll get used to it.
				Micah: [#sprite=happy]Or not. => sarah
		- Eh, guess I am.
			Micah: Nah, you're alright. I was just playing around.[do Variables.set_char_var("NPC_1", "relationship", 4)] => sarah
- You're a mischievous one, aren't you?
	Micah: Not sure what that means, but people call me many things, so yeah, probably. 
	Micah: I'm just messing around though. 
	Micah: [#sprite=happy]Mostly. 
	- You're funny. I like you. 
		Micah: [#sprite=happy]Haha. Awesome. [do Variables.set_char_var("NPC_1", "relationship", 4)]
		Micah: Adults usually think I'm annoying. => sarah
	- Careful not to mess with the wrong person sometime. 
		Micah: Eh, I'll be fine. => sarah 
	- You should tone it down a bit. 
		Micah: [#sprite=upset]Uh, not sure I wanna do that.[do Variables.set_char_var("NPC_1", "relationship", 2)] => sarah

